 "words": 254,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The famine came to Canaan and the fields were cracked and bare",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Old Jacob sent his sons to Egypt, there was grain for buying there",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They bowed before the governor, they did not know his face",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The brother that they sold away was standing in that place",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He could not hold it any longer, so he cleared the room",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And wept so loud that all of Pharaoh's household heard it too",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I am Joseph, your brother, whom you sold into Egypt",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Come closer to me",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 2.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You intended evil against me",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.98,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But God intended it for good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To accomplish what is now being done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The saving of many lives",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 4.87,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So do not be afraid",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 2.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will provide for you and your children",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be distressed, and do not be angry with yourselves that you sold me here",
   "heard": 16,
   "words": 16,
   "error_s": 12.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "God sent me ahead of you to preserve life",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 13.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It was not you who sent me here, but God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 13.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The years went by and Jacob died, the brothers shook with fear",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 11.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "What if he holds a grudge against us, now our father is not here",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 11.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They fell down at his feet and said, we are your slaves today",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 14.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But Joseph wept and spoke to them, and kindly he would say",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 12.7,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You intended evil against me",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 11.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But God intended it for good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 12.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To accomplish what is now being done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 13.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The saving of many lives",
   "heard": 5,
